        "Title": "WOD: Eliminate The New York Route.",
        "Location": "LOCATION_GREEDY_RACCOON",
        "PublicId": "124036640780",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Greedy/mission_raccoon/scene_raccoon_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f7606890-2c29-4e9c-973b-9ae71facf9f6).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to New York. We have intercepted a huge shipment of illicit substances and have been told some of the workers here have taken part in using the vault system to store and smuggle illegal drugs. Your first Target is Brendon Hawk. Brendon is a member of the cartel, and the manager of The New York route. He is by the staff area talking to his other associates: Freeman Luoma and Ashley Brendt. The client who is a very angry corrupt lawyer. We will deal with her later. This is the war on drugs",
